The title text, "An easing lesson", is still faint because it's mid-fade. Between **0.5 s and 1.5 s**, Title's Position, Scale and Opacity all change at a **constant speed**. That's what linear keys do. The motion starts at full speed and stops dead, with no speeding up or slowing down. That's why it feels mechanical.

